    <region region-id="100" left="20" top="80" width="600" height="25" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="80" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Heading 1" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">TERMODINAMICA DE SOLUCIONES - EJERCICIO 2 (SRK)</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="101" left="20" top="115" width="650" height="30" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="115" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Mezcla ternaria liquida: Benceno(1), Ciclohexano(2), Naftaleno(3) en tanque atmosferico a 300 K.</p>
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Composicion: x1 = 0.60, x3 = 0.30 -&gt; x2 = 1 - x1 - x3 = 0.10. Modelo: Soave-Redlich-Kwong (SRK).</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="102" left="20" top="155" width="550" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="155" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Parametros criticos, factor acentrico y composicion de la mezcla</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="103" left="50" top="185" width="90" height="40" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="185" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ml:real>562.2</ml:real><ml:real>553.6</ml:real><ml:real>748.4</ml:real></ml:matrix></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="104" left="170" top="185" width="90" height="40" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="170" align-y="185" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ml:real>48.98</ml:real><ml:real>40.73</ml:real><ml:real>40.51</ml:real></ml:matrix></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="105" left="290" top="185" width="90" height="40" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="290" align-y="185" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id><ml:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ml:real>0.210</ml:real><ml:real>0.210</ml:real><ml:real>0.302</ml:real></ml:matrix></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="106" left="410" top="185" width="90" height="40" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="410" align-y="185" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id><ml:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ml:real>0.60</ml:real><ml:real>0.10</ml:real><ml:real>0.30</ml:real></ml:matrix></ml:define></math>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="107" left="50" top="250" width="80" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="250" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="1">x</ml:id><ml:real>0.60</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="108" left="170" top="250" width="80" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="170" align-y="250" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="2">x</ml:id><ml:real>0.10</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="109" left="290" top="250" width="80" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="290" align-y="250" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="3">x</ml:id><ml:real>0.30</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="110" left="20" top="280" width="650" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="280" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">PARTE A) Fugacidad de Benceno(1) Puro vs Mezcla en funcion de T (P = 1 atm). Evaluacion a T = 450 K</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="111" left="20" top="305" width="650" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="305" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Condiciones: Presion constante P = 1 atm = 1.01325 bar, Temperatura T = 450 K.</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="112" left="50" top="330" width="90" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="330" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">T</ml:id><ml:real>450</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="113" left="170" top="330" width="90" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="170" align-y="330" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id><ml:real>1.01325</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>

    <region region-id="114" left="50" top="355" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="355" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Coeficientes de fugacidad puros ϕ_L.puro:</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="115" left="320" top="355" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="355" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Coeficientes de fugacidad en mezcla ϕ_L.mezcla:</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="116" left="50" top="375" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="375" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK.puro">ϕ</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="117" left="320" top="375" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="375" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK">ϕ</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>

    <region region-id="118" left="50" top="450" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="450" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Fugacidad de puros f_puro = ϕ_puro * P (bar):</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="119" left="320" top="450" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="450" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Fugacidad Benceno(1) en mezcla f1_hat (bar):</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="120" left="50" top="470" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="470" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval>
            <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:apply>
                    <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK.puro">ϕ</ml:id>
                    <ml:sequence>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">T</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id>
                    </ml:sequence>
                </ml:apply>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
        </ml:eval></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="121" left="320" top="470" width="220" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="470" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval>
            <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:apply>
                    <ml:mult />
                    <ml:real>0.60</ml:real>
                    <ml:apply>
                        <ml:indexer />
                        <ml:apply>
                            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK">ϕ</ml:id>
                            <ml:sequence>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">T</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id>
                            </ml:sequence>
                        </ml:apply>
                        <ml:real>1</ml:real>
                    </ml:apply>
                </ml:apply>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="A">P</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
        </ml:eval></math>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="122" left="20" top="545" width="650" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="545" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">PARTE B) Fugacidad de Benceno(1) Puro vs Mezcla en funcion de P (T = 300 K). Evaluacion a P = 10 atm</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="123" left="20" top="570" width="650" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="570" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Condiciones: Temperatura constante T = 300 K, Presion P = 10 atm = 10.1325 bar.</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="124" left="50" top="595" width="90" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="595" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">T</ml:id><ml:real>300</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="125" left="170" top="595" width="90" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="170" align-y="595" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id><ml:real>10.1325</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>

    <region region-id="126" left="50" top="620" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="620" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Coeficientes de fugacidad puros a 10 atm:</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="127" left="320" top="620" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="620" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Coeficientes de fugacidad en mezcla a 10 atm:</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="128" left="50" top="640" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="640" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK.puro">ϕ</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="129" left="320" top="640" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="640" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK">ϕ</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>

    <region region-id="130" left="50" top="715" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="715" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Fugacidad de puros f_puro (bar):</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="131" left="320" top="715" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="715" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Fugacidad Benceno(1) en mezcla f1_hat (bar):</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="132" left="50" top="735" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="735" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval>
            <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:apply>
                    <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK.puro">ϕ</ml:id>
                    <ml:sequence>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">T</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id>
                        <ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id>
                    </ml:sequence>
                </ml:apply>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
        </ml:eval></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="133" left="320" top="735" width="220" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="735" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval>
            <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:apply>
                    <ml:mult />
                    <ml:real>0.60</ml:real>
                    <ml:apply>
                        <ml:indexer />
                        <ml:apply>
                            <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK">ϕ</ml:id>
                            <ml:sequence>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">T</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id>
                                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id>
                            </ml:sequence>
                        </ml:apply>
                        <ml:real>1</ml:real>
                    </ml:apply>
                </ml:apply>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="B">P</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
        </ml:eval></math>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="134" left="20" top="810" width="650" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="810" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">PARTE C y D) Variacion de Volumen Molar y Calculo a P = 1 atm (1.01325 bar) y T = 400 K</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="135" left="20" top="835" width="650" height="30" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="835" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Al aumentar la temperatura a presion constante, el volumen de liquido se expande termicamente.</p>
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Orden de volumenes: V_Benceno &lt; V_mezcla &lt; V_Ciclohexano &lt; V_Naftaleno.</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="136" left="50" top="875" width="90" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="875" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">T</ml:id><ml:real>400</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="137" left="170" top="875" width="90" height="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="170" align-y="875" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:define><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">P</ml:id><ml:real>1.01325</ml:real></ml:define></math>
    </region>

    <region region-id="138" left="50" top="900" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="900" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Volumen molar de la mezcla liquida V_L (L/mol):</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="139" left="320" top="900" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="900" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Volumen molar de componentes puros V_puro (L/mol):</p>
        </text>
    </region>

    <region region-id="140" left="50" top="920" width="220" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="920" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK">V</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="141" left="320" top="920" width="220" height="50" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="320" align-y="920" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK.puro">V</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="142" left="50" top="990" width="250" height="15" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="990" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Factor de compresibilidad Z de la mezcla liquida:</p>
        </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="143" left="50" top="1010" width="220" height="20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="50" align-y="1010" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <math><ml:eval><ml:apply><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.SRK">z</ml:id><ml:sequence><ml:id xml:space="preserve">x</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="D">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ml:id><ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id></ml:sequence></ml:apply></ml:eval></math>
    </region>

    
    <region region-id="144" left="20" top="1050" width="650" height="55" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" align-x="20" align-y="1050" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
        <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">RESUMEN DE RESULTADOS NUMERICOS:</p>
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- A) A 450 K y 1 atm: f_puro(Benceno) = 8.218 bar, f_mezcla(Benceno) = 4.988 bar.</p>
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- B) A 300 K y 10 atm: f_puro(Benceno) = 0.1446 bar, f_mezcla(Benceno) = 0.0865 bar.</p>
            <p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- D) A 400 K y 1 atm: V_mezcla = 0.1267 L/mol, V_puros = [0.1130 (Benceno), 0.1354 (Ciclohexano), 0.1563 (Naftaleno)] L/mol.</p>
        </text>
    </region>
</regions>
